      "values": {
        "text": {
          "Text": "A pattern's colors are inputs, so a pattern can be painted with another. The Polka Dot's Input is a Stripes, read at the middle of each dot like a sign made of bulbs, and its Background is a Grid. A Master Gear slides the stripes along. Turn the Polka Dot's Frequency, Stagger and Radius, or the Stripes' Rotation."
        }
      },
